      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Hanska was platted in 1899 and became an incorporated village in 1901.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        13
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hanska%2C_Minnesota",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "In its early days, Hanska hosted a creamery, three grain elevators, a roller mill, and a Minneapolis and St. Paul rail station.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        10
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
